  "positive_checks": [
    "Force adapter matches stationary-frame light-drop pressure-gradient, virtual-mass, gravity and Schiller\u2013Naumann conventions in synthetic tracer, terminal-rise, acceleration, solid-body rotation and substep controls.",
    "Face injection conserves independent normal-flux mass and momentum for unequal branches; marker velocity magnitude and backflow controls do not become injection.",
    "Restart preserves parcel/cohort/RNG/size/terminal identity; conservative breakup transfers represented mass to daughters while immutable injected mass counts once.",
    "First-passage duplicate crossing is rejected; size-stratified inventory reconciles synchronized terminal/retained/unresolved/discrepancy masses and places unresolved oil in adverse concentration bounds.",
    "A completed synthetic case with 97% oil retained cannot qualify; sampling refuses fixed parcel defaults without complete residence-tail evidence."
  ],
